### Shared helpers referenced by the pipeline (same package)
- **`OwnerAddress.normalize`** — strip/collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand whole-token abbreviations `ST→STREET`, `RD→ROAD`, `AVE→AVENUE`; blank → `""`.
- **`OwnerTelephone.toE164`** — strips spaces/dashes/round+square brackets; `+` keeps country code; otherwise assumes `+61` and drops one leading `0`; result must match `[0-9]{8,15}` else returns `null`.
- **`OwnerHousehold`** (record `(lastName, address)`) — lastName lower-cased/whitespace-collapsed, address via `OwnerAddress.normalize`; equality = "same household". Used by `CheckOwnerHouseholdUnique` and `AssignHousehold`.
- **`BusinessDay`** — `rollForward` pushes Sat→Mon (+2), Sun→Mon (+1); `effective(supplied)` = supplied or `LocalDate.now()`, then rolled forward.

### `OwnerMapper.java` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`)
MapStruct interface, `@Mapper(uses = PetMapper.class)`, component model `spring` (set via compiler arg). `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` ignores `id` and `pets`. `toOwnerDto(Owner)` computes expression-based fields: `displayName`, `initials`, `membershipNumber` (`customerCode + "-M" + yy`), `membershipTier` (SILVER when `namesakeCount==0` and email non-blank, else BRONZE), `locality` via `Regions.localityOf(city)`.

